### 2.2 Incident Management

**Incident Severity Classification:**

| Severity | Impact | Users Affected | Response | Resolution |
|----------|--------|----------------|----------|-----------|
| **1 - Critical** | System down/unusable | All | 15 min | 4 hrs |
| **2 - High** | Major degradation | >50% | 1 hour | 8 hrs |
| **3 - Medium** | Noticeable degradation | <50% | 4 hrs | 24 hrs |
| **4 - Low** | Minimal impact | <10% | 24 hrs | 5 days |

**Incident Response Process:**

```
1. Detection (0 min)
   ↓ Alert triggered by monitoring
   ↓ PagerDuty notifies on-call engineer
   
2. Acknowledgment (0-5 min)
   ↓ On-call engineer acknowledges alert
   ↓ Incident created in PagerDuty
   ↓ Slack channel #incident-response created
   
3. Investigation (5-30 min)
   ↓ Gather facts
   ↓ Determine severity
   ↓ Identify affected services
   ↓ Look for recent changes
   
4. Communication (starts at 5 min)
   ↓ Update internal team every 15 minutes
   ↓ Update customer (if customer-visible) every 30 minutes
   
5. Mitigation (varies)
   ↓ For Sev 1: Begin mitigation immediately (no approval needed)
   ↓ For Sev 2+: Determine best approach (rollback vs. hotfix vs. restart)
   ↓ Execute mitigation
   ↓ Verify resolution
   
6. Resolution (when issue fixed)
   ↓ Notify customer
   ↓ Monitor for stability (30 minutes)
   ↓ Create post-mortem task
   
7. Post-Mortem (within 48 hours)
   ↓ Root cause analysis
   ↓ Timeline of events
   ↓ Action items to prevent recurrence
   ↓ Document and share learnings
```

**Incident Communication Template:**
```
Initial Notification (Tier 1 → Team):
"Incident declared: [Severity] [System]
Description: [Brief description]
Affected: [Services/Users affected]
Status: [Investigating/Mitigating/Resolved]
ETA: [Time estimate]
Ticket: [Link to tracking system]"

Update (Every 15-30 minutes):
"Update - [Time since incident start]
Status: [Current status]
Actions taken: [What we've done]
Current focus: [What we're working on now]
Next update: [In X minutes]"

Resolution:
"Incident resolved
Duration: [Total time]
Root cause: [Brief description]
Impact: [Actual impact]
Action items: [Created for follow-up]"
```

